      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-dc858ea1af9d50e93e2de816",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Ⅲ期研究主要目的为证明对于主要估计目标，第16周，达到银屑病面积和严重程度指数较基线至少改善75%的参与者比例（PASI 75应答），达到PGA评分为0或1的参与者比例（PGA-TS），CMS-D001片均优于安慰剂。针对上述主要估计目标的均采取如下的假设检验：设定CMS-D001片的PASI 75应答率为π_11、安慰剂的应答比例为π_10；CMS-D001片的PGA-TS应答比例为π_21，安慰剂的应答比例为π_20；",
      "heading_path": [
        "统计学考虑",
        "统计假设"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1172"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "phase_iii"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30350,
      "source_ref": "body.p1172",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1172"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-92cda4f134367875bbf58f21",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "假设如下：",
      "heading_path": [
        "统计学考虑",
        "统计假设"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1173"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "phase_iii"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 30360,
      "source_ref": "body.p1173",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1173"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-83a2eb74b16a38f168df6652",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "H_0：ℼ_11- ℼ_10 ≤0 或 ℼ_21- ℼ_20 ≤0",
      "heading_path": [
